{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "purpose": "The components behind every link of config/transport-inventory.json (owner, 2026-11-12): what each lane runs for it, and which links it serves. scripts/transport-bom.py resolves each artifact (image references and digests from the compose files and release/images.json, host-tool floors) into config/transport-bom.json and docs/TRANSPORT_BOM.md. A lane entry is one of: source (a repository's artifacts), compose (services in a compose file), releaseImages (release/images.json), host (a host tool and the file naming its floor), external, user, planned (not deployed there yet, and why) or none (the lane has no such component, and why).",
